# librarian-daily-sync
owner: weaver · cadence: 0 9 * * * · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a daily sync that keeps the librarian's index fresh as topics, skills, bots, and loops change?**

## Prompt
Run the librarian indexer against all topic frontmatter and skill frontmatter, update the vault discovery manifest, and publish any delta to the wiki dashboard.

## Evidence
> We can have a librarian watching the whole thing and progressively discovering, wiki skills, bots, and loops.
